      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opheim%2C_Montana",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Opheim once hosted a U.S. Air Force General Surveillance Radar station, which closed in 1979 amid nationwide base reductions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
